                 Oh no! Looks like there's a break in the chain!                
                                                                                
      This project still keeps its beads in SQLite. Beads moved to Dolt in      
       v0.58, and current bd refuses this workspace until it is migrated.       
                                                                                
          Keep .beads unchanged and follow the sealed SQLite bridge in          
                 the cross-era upgrade guide of the beads docs:                 
              docs/getting-started/upgrading.md#cross-era-upgrades              
                                                                                
            Perles can read the project once it is migrated to Dolt.            
                                                                                
                                                                                
